  "contentHtml": "<p>감수분열 과정을 모형으로 만들어 영상을 제작하면</p><p>학습효과가 무척 좋습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그래서 올해도 만들어 보았습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>1. 활동 안내를 합니다.</b></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5c2f3f1a93df449d57d48c286f9a832530d5b59?download\" data-file-name=\"‘감수분열’ 동영상 제작 프로젝트(안내자료).hwp\" data-file-size=\"46592\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D135%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20221031120557&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc5c2f3f1a93df449d57d48c286f9a832530d5b59')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">‘감수분열’ 동영상 제작 프로젝트(안내자료)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">45.50KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec67df027294b8ab601a16defd3413b405e19a79?download\" data-file-name=\"VLLO앱 사용 설명서.PDF\" data-file-size=\"498463\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D135%26fileid%3D11%26regdt%3D20221031120557&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fec67df027294b8ab601a16defd3413b405e19a79')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">VLLO앱 사용 설명서</span><span class=\"type\">.PDF</span></div><div class=\"size\">486.78KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b>2. 모둠별로 만드는 과정을 피드백해줍니다.</b></p><p>&#160; 1) 정확히 표현해야 할 부분에 대한 정보를 제공합니다.&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SmXPR4yCu8E\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SmXPR4yCu8E</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2) 제작 과정에서 나타나는 작품의 오류를 사진찍어서 공유합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/222cd01a227a0133141d69b697e7e31dc240a0da\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"256\" height=\"180\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/222cd01a227a0133141d69b697e7e31dc240a0da\" data-origin-width=\"293\" data-origin-height=\"205\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/02df9d3ebbaebb77a029c41c42985730bf7759d0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"265\" height=\"170\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/02df9d3ebbaebb77a029c41c42985730bf7759d0\" data-origin-width=\"326\" data-origin-height=\"209\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b>3.&#160;발표 진행 순서</b></p><p>&#160;1) 각자 소감문(잘한점)작성 : 3쪽 학습지 뒷면에</p><p>&#160;2) 모둠별로 앞에 나와서 : 모둠원 역할소개 및</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 영화 제작진의 우리 영상의 관전 포인트 소개</p><p>&#160;3) 영화 시청</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Qgh-z95mHr8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/Qgh-z95mHr8</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qgh-z95mHr8\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/XnMmx/hyQpqTM8ny/iz3UFGCQ2HsCs9QKE9I09K/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qgh-z95mHr8\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;4) 다른 학생들은 시청하며 잘한 점 메모하기</p><p>&#160;5) 발표 모둠은 소감발표하기</p><p>&#160;6) 단톡방에&#160;</p><p>&#160; &#160; - 영상 작품에 하트 표시하기(인기투표)</p><p>&#160; &#160; - 다른 학생들은 잘한 점 or 질문 올리기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67c8ff39bdfab6b911978be8578e6bab66a1da09\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67c8ff39bdfab6b911978be8578e6bab66a1da09\" data-origin-width=\"315\" data-origin-height=\"439\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3316899db5940a8432e16dcd43911b0a947a9232\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3316899db5940a8432e16dcd43911b0a947a9232\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"470\"></div><p>학생들의 준비과정과 발표를 함께 하면서</p><p>보람되고 많이 행복한 시간이었습니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그리고 좋은 발표를 위한 아이디어 주신</p><p>박선영 선생님께 감사의 인사 드립니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3a59b25984a59a7ec096d57e713752033e8d767\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3a59b25984a59a7ec096d57e713752033e8d767\" data-origin-width=\"511\" data-origin-height=\"459\"></div><p>고맙습니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}